An unobtrusive tabletop composition of exercise elastic, folded cotton sleep mask and an unbranded water bottle, grounded in a lived space with soft directional daylight. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
